        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahazi ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahazi aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī; ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'ītandatū alī mu Yelusalemu. Ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA atītile yawiza gīt'ūmo walī wītīla nkūlūgenji wakwe Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū wei washimīzīlaga mu nzīla ja batemi ba Isilaeli, ūyūbeeja na shiikolile kūlwa kwilamīlīgīja kū būtongi wa Mabaalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyūja na kū longa lwa Hinomu waakafunya shitambò sha kūpemvwa; na bitūnja bakwe ūbapemba mu moto, kūlwa kūlondeela nhūngwa ja malofu ja mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wagapeeja gīkī gabīngīle a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafunyaga shitambò hamò na kūzuukīja būbbani kū mapandī ga higūlya, kū ngūlū pyī nū mu mbeho ja mitī ya madūūtū manīlīzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA Mulungu wakwe ūntūūla mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Alamu. A Baalamu būmpyena, būbasola banhū bakwe bingī būja nabo Damasiko mu būtungwa. Ūtūūlwa na mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Isilaeli, nang'hwe ūnkenaagūja banhū bakwe bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lūmò ū Peka ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia ūbūlaga ū mu Yelusalemu bashilikale shihūmbī igana na makūmi abīlī, nguno a banhū ba Yuda baalī bang'wība ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho munhū nebe lina lyakwe Zikili muna Efulaimu, ūmūlaga Maaseya ng'witūnja wa ntemi, na Azilikamu ntaale wa kahelele ka h'ikūlū, na Elikana ūyo walī wa kabīlī a halī ntemi ū mu mihayo ya būsugi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli būjana banhū shihūmbī magana abīlī kūfuma ū mu badūgū babo; bakīma na bayanda na banikī. Būsola na shikolo shingī būjana Samalia kūbiza nding'wa jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū kwenūko walīko ng'hangibo ng'wa SEEBA lina lyake Odedi, ūfuma kūjūbasūng'wanha a bashilikale benabo aho baliza ī Samalia; ūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bing'we walī wabapelanīlile a banhū ba Yuda, h'ī nguno yene wabatūūlile mu nkono gwing'we. Alīyo a bing'we ng'wababūlagaga mu kabūlagīle ka kūpelanya kūshisha ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī ī haha mulīhaya kūbīīta babize basese bing'we a bagosha na a bakīma ba Yuda nī Yelusalemu. Tūhaya a heene na a bing'we mulī bahūbi ū kūlī SEEBA ū Mulungu wing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nidegelekagi; bashoshagi kaya a badūgū bing'we abo ng'wabenhaga kūbiza nding'wa, nguno mulī ha sīlīlī ya būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū bamò na bamò ū mu batongeeji ba mu Efulaimu, Azalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehohanani, Belekia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Meshimeloti, Yehizikia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Salūmu na Amasa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hadilai; bīmīīla kūbahangīja a banhū abo bakiza kūfuma ū kū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbawīla, “Mutabenhage kūūnū a banhū benaba abo ng'wabadimaga kūfuma kū būlūgū, tūkūbiza mu kwihīga ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. A bing'we gashi ī gete mulīkooba kūbongeja ū būhūbi wise nū kwihīga kwise! Nguno ū kwihīga kwise a bise kūlī kūtaale ng'hana ng'hana, hama ī Isilaeli īlī ha sīlīlī ya būpelanu wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bashilikale benabo būbaleka a banhū abo baalī babadima benabo nī shikolo īsho baalī biza nasho, būbatūūla mu makono ga batongeeji na ha sīlīlī ya banhū abo baalī bibilinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū balebe būsolanhyiwa, būbagunanha a bading'wa benabo; būsola shizwalo kūfuma ū mu shikolo īsho shalī shading'wa būbazwalīkīja abo baalī dūūhū. Būzwala myenda na shilatū, būbinha na shilīwa na minzī ga kūng'wa; būbabila na būgota a magulagīje gabo. Abo baalī baaleba būbadamhīja ha nzobe pye a bose, hūna būbatwala Yeliko kū baana ba ng'wabo; kū nzengo gwa mitī ya nhende, a boi būshoka Samalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpyenwa na kūcha kwa ng'wa Ahazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū ntemi Ahazi ūtūma banhū kūlī ntemi wa Ashulu gīkī ize angunanhe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno a Baedomu bakiza hangī bīdumīla ī Yuda, būdima banhū bingī būbajana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti nabo būdumīla mizengo ya kū mitulumenho ya kū ngūlū ja Yuda, nū kū sī y'itogolo lya Negevu. Bīdima mizengo ya Beti-sheshi, Aijaloni, Gedeloti, na Soko, Timuna, na Gimuzo, na a magūngūli ayo gaalī gīpīndīlīgije; hama bikala na kwikala moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akabīītīla gīko a banhū ba Yuda kūlwa kūbiicha ha sīlīlī gete, nguno ya ng'wa Ahazi ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, īkī walī wingīja mihayo mingī ya malofu ū mu sī ya Yuda; nīyo ū kūlī SEEBA akongeja no ū kūbiza wabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Ashulu, ū Tigilasi-pilesa, wiza ū kūlī we; alīyo a ha ng'wanya gwa kūngunanha, ūng'ongegeja makoye dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Ahazi akasola shikolo shimò na shimò kūfuma ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nū mu numba y'ikūlū, na kūfuma mu kaya ja batongeeji ba sī, ūng'winha ū ntemi wa Ashulu; alīyo naheene ī shenīsho shitangunanhile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Ahazi aho alī ng'wikanza lya makoye gīko, ongeja no no no ū kūbiza wabūbi ū kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyūfunya shitambò kū mamulungu ga bana Damasiko abo baalī bampyena, nguno wiganikaga gīkī, “Īkī a bamulungu ba Baalamu bakūbagunanhaga a banhū babo, hambū hambū nabafunīje shitambò, hamo bakūnigunanha nū nene!” Alīyo a benabo hū būbiza ba kūngwisha, pyī nī Isilaeli ī yose bīgwisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahazi ūshikuminga pyī ī shiseme sha mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu ūshīnja, wīlugala ī milyango ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. Hūna ūzenga myalīlo būlī ha nzīla maaka ū mu Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a hose ū mu mizengo ya Yuda ūbeeja mapandī ga higūlya ga kūyūbafunīja koi shitambò bamulungu bangī, ongeja gete ū kūmpelanya ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
